      adverseEffects: ["Bone and extremity pain, leukocytosis, and injection-site symptoms can occur because marrow production is accelerated.", "Rare serious effects include splenic rupture, ARDS, anaphylaxis, sickle-cell crisis, glomerulonephritis, thrombocytopenia, capillary-leak syndrome, and aortitis."],
